{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/b3cfba615e512d430bf57d7e668219a4.poster.avif?t=1768344167\" width=616 height=575 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/b3cfba615e512d430bf57d7e668219a4.webm?t=1768344167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BECOME THE SLAYER IN A MEDIEVAL WAR AGAINST HELL</strong><br>DOOM: The Dark Ages is the prequel to the critically acclaimed DOOM (2016) and DOOM Eternal that tells an epic cinematic story worthy of the DOOM Slayer\u2019s legend. In this third installment of the modern DOOM series, players will step into the blood-stained boots of the DOOM Slayer, in this never-before-seen dark and sinister medieval war against Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DOOM: The Dark Ages is a dark fantasy/sci-fi single-player experience that delivers the searing combat and over-the-top visuals of the incomparable DOOM franchise, powered by the latest idTech engine.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/fa179f422df5e730d7eb0dfb7d4ce9ba.poster.avif?t=1768344167\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/fa179f422df5e730d7eb0dfb7d4ce9ba.webm?t=1768344167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>REIGN IN HELL</strong>  <br>As the super weapon of gods and kings, shred enemies with devastating favorites like the Super Shotgun while also wielding a variety of new bone-chewing weapons, including the versatile Shield Saw. Players will stand and fight on the demon-infested battlefields in the vicious, grounded combat the original DOOM is famous for.  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/f61e69d3d167342f18d2cab81a78672c.poster.avif?t=1768344167\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/f61e69d3d167342f18d2cab81a78672c.webm?t=1768344167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>STAND AND FIGHT</strong><br>Experience an epic story of the DOOM Slayer\u2019s rage in this cinematic and action-packed story. Bound to serve as the super weapon of gods and kings, the DOOM Slayer fends off demon hordes as their leader seeks to destroy the Slayer and become the only one that is feared. Witness the creation of a legend as the Slayer takes on all of Hell and turns the tide of the war.  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/61690161285d5ce4864777bd5e8b7e4c.poster.avif?t=1768344167\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/61690161285d5ce4864777bd5e8b7e4c.webm?t=1768344167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>DISCOVER UNKNOWN REALMS</strong>  <br>In his quest to crush the legions of Hell, the Slayer must take the fight to never-before-seen realms. Mystery, challenges, and rewards lurk in every shadow of ruined castles, epic battlefields, dark forests, ancient hellscapes, and worlds beyond. Armed with the viciously powerful Shield Saw, cut through a dark world of menace and secrets in id's largest and most expansive levels to date.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Dark Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3017860/9d3c9dede6c965503871536ab0de801621a72dc7.jpg"},{"name":"Supersized Brawl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3017860/a87d0cd1af1662d8d85856e287bc8c09358291ad.jpg"},{"name":"Bringing the House Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3017860/b087b2815853790004e155b552afc79b46e17f26.jpg"},{"name":"Jailbreak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3017860/05b05c47b77c08c45c29cecba5deef61169d2571.jpg"},{"name":"Too Angry to Die","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3017860/9bd2c4e47673a869effd356d8ccb62b8cfac7106.jpg"},{"name":"Argent Return","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3017860/77647563e1e7664f12e6a7d0c4a3ef3983026b37.jpg"},{"name":"The Only Thing They Fear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3017860/86ea1deded8c449b74216c8f98cf2806c27d67bb.jpg"},{"name":"Game Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3017860/d560a35c46f0d341ce8ffdcdf652843a09daac04.jpg"},{"name":"Vagary Down!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3017860/d21e7c54c5361e8f79d2e17fff9540ddb1931b73.jpg"},{"name":"Agaddon Champion Down!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3017860/cdc88b64061d44c45ca2f41a26e21d8996635897.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3017860?t=1768344167","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768344167","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/4b39d554fb3b3a48ff02e2f05bba7186a58052ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768344167","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/4b39d554fb3b3a48ff02e2f05bba7186a58052ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768344167","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and Gore, Intense Violence"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>PREMIUM EDITION</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/ee59522e64c1ce518df1a65426e8e8b6.avif?t=1768344167\" width=616 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand and Fight with the Premium Edition, including the campaign DLC*, Digital Artbook and Soundtrack, and the Divinity Skin Pack, which includes matching skins for the DOOM Slayer, dragon and Atlan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INCLUDES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Base Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Campaign DLC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Digital Artbook and Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Divinity Skin Pack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*DLC availability to be provided at a later date. </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/b3cfba615e512d430bf57d7e668219a4.poster.avif?t=1768344167\" width=616 height=575 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/b3cfba615e512d430bf57d7e668219a4.webm?t=1768344167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BECOME THE SLAYER IN A MEDIEVAL WAR AGAINST HELL</strong><br>DOOM: The Dark Ages is the prequel to the critically acclaimed DOOM (2016) and DOOM Eternal that tells an epic cinematic story worthy of the DOOM Slayer\u2019s legend. In this third installment of the modern DOOM series, players will step into the blood-stained boots of the DOOM Slayer, in this never-before-seen dark and sinister medieval war against Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DOOM: The Dark Ages is a dark fantasy/sci-fi single-player experience that delivers the searing combat and over-the-top visuals of the incomparable DOOM franchise, powered by the latest idTech engine.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/fa179f422df5e730d7eb0dfb7d4ce9ba.poster.avif?t=1768344167\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/fa179f422df5e730d7eb0dfb7d4ce9ba.webm?t=1768344167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>REIGN IN HELL</strong>  <br>As the super weapon of gods and kings, shred enemies with devastating favorites like the Super Shotgun while also wielding a variety of new bone-chewing weapons, including the versatile Shield Saw. Players will stand and fight on the demon-infested battlefields in the vicious, grounded combat the original DOOM is famous for.  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/f61e69d3d167342f18d2cab81a78672c.poster.avif?t=1768344167\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/f61e69d3d167342f18d2cab81a78672c.webm?t=1768344167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>STAND AND FIGHT</strong><br>Experience an epic story of the DOOM Slayer\u2019s rage in this cinematic and action-packed story. Bound to serve as the super weapon of gods and kings, the DOOM Slayer fends off demon hordes as their leader seeks to destroy the Slayer and become the only one that is feared. Witness the creation of a legend as the Slayer takes on all of Hell and turns the tide of the war.  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/61690161285d5ce4864777bd5e8b7e4c.poster.avif?t=1768344167\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/extras/61690161285d5ce4864777bd5e8b7e4c.webm?t=1768344167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>DISCOVER UNKNOWN REALMS</strong>  <br>In his quest to crush the legions of Hell, the Slayer must take the fight to never-before-seen realms. Mystery, challenges, and rewards lurk in every shadow of ruined castles, epic battlefields, dark forests, ancient hellscapes, and worlds beyond. Armed with the viciously powerful Shield Saw, cut through a dark world of menace and secrets in id's largest and most expansive levels to date.</p>","developers":["id Software"],"dlc":[3698350],"drm_notice":"Denuvo Anti-Tamper","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017860/header.jpg?t=1768344167","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 ZeniMax. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</stro